+/*
+ * ECMA-335 metadata writer: IMetaDataEmit, IMetaDataEmit2 and IMetaDataAssemblyEmit.
+ *
+ * This file is #included by metadata.c (it shares the table schema and the reader's
+ * structures). The writable scope keeps a model of the tables: every row is an array of
+ * raw column values in the encoding of the file format (heap offsets, coded indexes),
+ * and the heaps are growable byte arrays with duplicate detection. Imports on a writable
+ * scope are served by serialising the model and loading it with the reader.
+ *
+ * Written from the published ECMA-335 standard (partition II, metadata physical layout)
+ * and the documented behaviour of the metadata APIs.
